        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best driveway sealer at Menards?</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-700">For asphalt driveways, Gardner Blacktop Driveway Sealer is the best all-around pick — solid body, reliable availability, and an easy application for first-time DIYers. For concrete driveways, SEAL-KRETE Original is the top pick. Match the type to your surface.</p>
